  "id": "technical",
  "term": "technical",
  "definition": "In this source, technical refers to measurable aspects of performance in a match, such as actions involved in attacking, passing, defending, or discipline. It is used to distinguish these skill-based indicators from tactical, contextual, and player-related factors in outcome analysis.",
